  "about": "No doubt - technology has always been my greatest passion.  The MS-DOS prompt and 5 1/4-inch floppy disks are among my earliest memories.  By 13 I was officially hacking away on computers. And at UC Berkeley I majored in Computer Science.  \n\nI’m a pretty good salesman too.  As a sales manager at Moxie, I brought in 1M in annual recurring revenue through my leadership, management, and personal sales effort. I earned the honor of top salesman nationwide.\n\nMy experiences in sales lit a fire inside me, one that still guides me today.  They taught me that I can accomplish great things, by focusing all of my effort on the realization of a goal.\n\nI’m optimistic about the problems that technology can solve, and I’m excited to help bring these solutions to life.",
